<div xmlns:str="http://exslt.org/strings" id="search_remark"><div>Check the information on costs for open access publishing by clicking on a journal title in the list below. This gives you an overview of open access publishing options, including any discounted open access costs and impact metrics for that journal.</div></div>
<div class="journal_suggestion">
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://library.wur.nl/WebQuery/utbrowser/326"><i>Do you mean the journal "<b>NeuroImage</b>"?</i></a> </div>
</div>
<div class="d-block d-lg-none mobile-facet-container">
<a class="btn btn-info" id="filter-button" data-toggle="collapse" href="#collapseFilters" role="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFilters">
                Filters <span id="active_filters_count"></span></a><div class="collapse" id="collapseFilters">
